{"4117080": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "United We Forge", "steam_appid": 4117080, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Build Synergy or Dominate Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race thrives on its own strengths, but true mastery comes from <strong>combining unlikely allies</strong>. The more diverse your team, the greater your potential — inspired by <strong>Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI)</strong> principles, your deck’s harmony determines its might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/8d39abc31b3274431305b124346a75e5.avif?t=1764327799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras_big/8d39abc31b3274431305b124346a75e5.webp?t=1764327799 width=1560 height=1148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 Craft Your Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match takes place inside a <strong>realistic 3D forge environment</strong>, where your chosen creatures work together to <strong>produce armor and equipment</strong> tied to their cultural identity. To craft the best gear, you’ll need the right races, the right synergies, and the right strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/df216d7ff0d8e0c3ffe9793ff022c898.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Improvement Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Improvement Cards to boost your employees’ performance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one Improvement Card per turn</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each employee can only hold <strong>one Improvement Card</strong> during their contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/d6b389b94a96cf6be70f822183e53956.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/df31b09cf79a0fda3eb4a3b7dc9d5be5.webp?t=1764327799\" width=48 height=16 /></span>Accomodation Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accommodation Cards enhance specific races by improving their work environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one Accommodation Card per turn</strong>, but only on an <strong>employee of a matching race</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each employee can only have <strong>one Accommodation Card</strong> active during their contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/2d1ce0d5f9b094266b8fa2a7b24b7d2b.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/e03a489fdba806e6e273804e6d1896ea.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Malice Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Malice Cards to disrupt your opponents’ workforce.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one per turn</strong>, targeting <strong>any opposing employee</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards last <strong>contract time</strong>, unless they cause a <strong>reduction in production</strong> <strong>for the entire workers</strong>. In that case, they are removed <strong>after the turns' end</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/89c5a1c5071ee026a407f40b42bf0c0e.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/c9aac160ab4be0d71dcaf6cc8b042bd9.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span>DEI Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEI (Diversity, Equality &amp; Inclusion) Cards reward unity and cooperation in your forge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only play them <strong>once your forge includes all races of employees</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only <strong>one can be played per turn</strong>, and it will be <strong>removed at the end of turn</strong> if it applies to <strong>all workers</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/77caac40f7580c3c35d19131ca9022a5.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Strategic Depth, Endless Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless combinations, faction bonuses, and tactical plays, no two matches are the same. Outsmart your opponent by reading their strategy, predicting their plays, and crafting victory card by card.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Player vs Player Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or other players online in intense <strong>PvP duels</strong>. Build decks that reflect your playstyle — whether you prefer brute force, clever synergy, or full-spectrum cooperation.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >⚔️ Build Synergy or Dominate Alone</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each race thrives on its own strengths, but true mastery comes from <strong>combining unlikely allies</strong>. The more diverse your team, the greater your potential — inspired by <strong>Diversity, Equity, and Inclusion (DEI)</strong> principles, your deck’s harmony determines its might.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/8d39abc31b3274431305b124346a75e5.avif?t=1764327799\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras_big/8d39abc31b3274431305b124346a75e5.webp?t=1764327799 width=1560 height=1148 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🔨 Craft Your Legacy</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Every match takes place inside a <strong>realistic 3D forge environment</strong>, where your chosen creatures work together to <strong>produce armor and equipment</strong> tied to their cultural identity. To craft the best gear, you’ll need the right races, the right synergies, and the right strategy.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/df216d7ff0d8e0c3ffe9793ff022c898.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span> Improvement Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Improvement Cards to boost your employees’ performance.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one Improvement Card per turn</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each employee can only hold <strong>one Improvement Card</strong> during their contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/d6b389b94a96cf6be70f822183e53956.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/df31b09cf79a0fda3eb4a3b7dc9d5be5.webp?t=1764327799\" width=48 height=16 /></span>Accomodation Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Accommodation Cards enhance specific races by improving their work environment.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one Accommodation Card per turn</strong>, but only on an <strong>employee of a matching race</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Each employee can only have <strong>one Accommodation Card</strong> active during their contract.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/2d1ce0d5f9b094266b8fa2a7b24b7d2b.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/e03a489fdba806e6e273804e6d1896ea.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span>Malice Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use Malice Cards to disrupt your opponents’ workforce.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can play <strong>one per turn</strong>, targeting <strong>any opposing employee</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >These cards last <strong>contract time</strong>, unless they cause a <strong>reduction in production</strong> <strong>for the entire workers</strong>. In that case, they are removed <strong>after the turns' end</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/89c5a1c5071ee026a407f40b42bf0c0e.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/c9aac160ab4be0d71dcaf6cc8b042bd9.webp?t=1764327799\" width=16 height=16 /></span>DEI Cards</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >DEI (Diversity, Equality &amp; Inclusion) Cards reward unity and cooperation in your forge.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can only play them <strong>once your forge includes all races of employees</strong>.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Only <strong>one can be played per turn</strong>, and it will be <strong>removed at the end of turn</strong> if it applies to <strong>all workers</strong>.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/extras/77caac40f7580c3c35d19131ca9022a5.avif?t=1764327799\" width=1009 height=560 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧠 Strategic Depth, Endless Replayability</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With countless combinations, faction bonuses, and tactical plays, no two matches are the same. Outsmart your opponent by reading their strategy, predicting their plays, and crafting victory card by card.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >🧑‍🤝‍🧑 Player vs Player Battles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Challenge friends or other players online in intense <strong>PvP duels</strong>. Build decks that reflect your playstyle — whether you prefer brute force, clever synergy, or full-spectrum cooperation.</p>", "short_description": "Deep beneath the mountains lies a living forge, where rival creatures — Ogres, Goblins, and Amphibians — must set aside their grudges to craft powerful gear. In this competitive card strategy game, every card you play shapes the delicate balance between power and collaboration.", "supported_languages": "English, French", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/f39aea86f6d6fcd3926d3dfb3485b276dd57d628/header.jpg?t=1764327799", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/d8102e530410854bbacb4551f8814026b09c9830/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1764327799", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4117080/d8102e530410854bbacb4551f8814026b09c9830/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1764327799", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen 3 3100 / Intel i3-8100<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> Nvidia GTX 1650 4GB / AMD RX 5500XT 4GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX® 9.0c compatible sound card with latest drivers</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 or newer, 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> AMD Ryzen5 3600 / Intel i5-10400<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA RTX 2060 6GB / AMD RX 6600 8GB<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 4 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX® 9.0c compatible sound card with latest drivers</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["FrostBite"], "publishers": ["FrostBite"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 49, "description": "PvP"}, {"id": 36, "description": "Online PvP"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 68, "description": "Custom Volume Controls"}, {"id": 75, "description": "Keyboard Only Option"}, {"id": 76, "description": "Mouse Only Option"}, {"id": 74, "description": "Playable without Timed Input"}, {"id": 69, "description": "Stereo Sound"}, {"id": 62, "description": "Family Sharing"}], "genres": [{"id": "2", "descrip